WEBVTT

00:03.310 --> 00:06.230
<i>I... Itsuomi-san.</i>

00:06.230 --> 00:09.260
"It's okay if it's me"? 
How much does that cover?

00:10.080 --> 00:11.490
<i>Everything.</i>

00:14.000 --> 00:18.790
<i>What's that kiss to the hand supposed to mean?</i>

01:46.210 --> 01:50.000
I Thought I Wanted to Keep Watching Her Forever

01:51.250 --> 01:52.500
Yuki?

01:56.200 --> 01:57.350
You okay?

01:59.960 --> 02:01.190
<i>Calm down.</i>

02:01.400 --> 02:04.280
<i>My phone... Where's my phone?</i>

02:04.280 --> 02:07.050
<i>Oh, I had it in my pocket!</i>

02:09.150 --> 02:12.360
Why do you want to learn sign language?

02:09.150 --> 02:12.360
Feeling lightheaded?

02:09.830 --> 02:11.620
<i>Oh, no...</i>

02:12.480 --> 02:15.610
I'm fine, sorry.

02:15.860 --> 02:20.740
If you're fine,

02:17.860 --> 02:20.740
then look my way.

02:21.350 --> 02:23.310
<i>I'm getting too flustered.</i>

02:23.310 --> 02:26.750
<i>But given what he just did...</i>

02:27.910 --> 02:31.250
<i>He never has any concept of personal space!</i>

02:34.500 --> 02:37.460
<b></b>Did you understand my signing?

02:34.500 --> 02:37.460
<b></b>Did you understand my signing?

02:37.460 --> 02:38.510
Huh?

02:39.120 --> 02:41.480
Oh, yeah.

02:42.450 --> 02:43.700
"Everything."

02:46.530 --> 02:47.770
Is that so?

02:48.280 --> 02:51.780
<i>That must've made my feelings for him obvious.</i>

02:52.200 --> 02:55.180
<i>He's an observant guy...</i>

02:56.150 --> 02:58.740
<i>And he's staring at me full on!</i>

02:59.320 --> 03:00.740
<b></b>What is it?

02:59.320 --> 03:00.740
<b></b>What is it?

03:02.820 --> 03:09.910
About Rin...

03:07.410 --> 03:09.910
It seemed like she was coming
to our bar to see Kyouya.

03:09.960 --> 03:12.040
What about you?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.920
There to see me?

03:17.360 --> 03:20.790
<i>Okay, he probably knows.</i>

03:26.470 --> 03:28.390
It's just...

03:28.430 --> 03:30.940
That's the feeling I got.

03:29.830 --> 03:30.940
<i>See?</i>

03:32.630 --> 03:33.690
<i>But...</i>

03:34.200 --> 03:37.960
<i>I bet he doesn't know how 
intense my feelings are.</i>

03:39.440 --> 03:46.470
<i>Or how figuring out these 
love-adjacent feelings within me</i>

03:46.870 --> 03:50.890
<i>opened my eyes to just 
how much I had to learn.</i>

03:51.750 --> 03:56.750
I love you.

04:00.210 --> 04:01.370
I know.

04:01.370 --> 04:03.020
Yeah, yeah.

04:03.020 --> 04:04.890
<i>He wasn't looking!</i>

04:04.890 --> 04:06.100
Oh, sorry.

04:06.460 --> 04:09.630
The bar's booked out 
for a private party tonight,

04:09.630 --> 04:10.870
so I should go in early.

04:10.870 --> 04:11.680
<i>Huh?</i>

04:11.950 --> 04:15.020
Also, I'm going overseas again on Monday.

04:16.050 --> 04:18.440
I'll be back around the end of spring break.

04:18.440 --> 04:20.110
<i>Does that mean...</i>

04:20.410 --> 04:23.160
<i>He'll be gone for a month and change?</i>

04:24.080 --> 04:25.770
<i>Oh...</i>

04:26.120 --> 04:30.370
Send me sign
language vids.

04:28.450 --> 04:30.370
I'll study up while I'm there.

04:35.120 --> 04:37.880
<b></b>Will do

04:35.120 --> 04:37.880
<b></b>Will do

04:40.720 --> 04:42.130
Once I'm back,

04:42.780 --> 04:44.130
I'll be sure

04:44.760 --> 04:45.880
to make time

04:46.590 --> 04:47.610
for us.

04:54.790 --> 04:56.360
Hmm? What's up?

04:59.480 --> 05:01.030
"Why...

05:02.320 --> 05:03.910
did you just..."

05:06.550 --> 05:07.910
Oh, that.

05:13.550 --> 05:18.470
<i>I taught him what patting 
the head means in sign before.</i>

05:20.210 --> 05:21.500
<b></b>Yuki...

05:20.210 --> 05:21.500
Yuki...

05:21.750 --> 05:26.220
<b></b>May I fall for you?

05:21.750 --> 05:26.220
May I fall for you?

05:31.060 --> 05:34.020
<b></b>Are you okay for time?

05:31.060 --> 05:34.020
<b></b>Are you okay for time?

05:35.940 --> 05:37.050
Right.

05:46.650 --> 05:52.180
<i>Breathing in the cool, 
fresh air is calming me down.</i>

05:52.180 --> 05:53.040
Huh?

05:53.310 --> 05:55.290
Yuki!

06:02.200 --> 06:03.360
Huh?

06:03.360 --> 06:05.050
Whoa, what's up?!

06:05.600 --> 06:07.950
<i>We only met for a short while,</i>

06:07.950 --> 06:14.020
<i>but I'm so happy he did for me what I'd only 
consider doing for people I truly care about</i>

06:14.550 --> 06:16.280
<i>that I'm starting to get carried away.</i>

06:18.800 --> 06:20.560
Yikes, it's cold.

06:21.780 --> 06:25.170
It might even snow again.

06:25.170 --> 06:26.400
Oushi-kun?

06:27.400 --> 06:29.120
Oh, Yuki's mom.

06:29.120 --> 06:30.660
Good evening.

06:30.660 --> 06:33.150
You're walking Mint-chan, are you?

06:33.150 --> 06:36.960
Izumi and her folks are on a trip 
right now, so I'm taking care of Mint.

06:36.960 --> 06:39.160
Lucky Izumi-chan.

06:39.630 --> 06:41.770
Feeling the wanderlust?

06:41.770 --> 06:46.670
Not that. I mean she's lucky 
for having such a nice friend.

06:46.940 --> 06:47.820
Right...

06:47.820 --> 06:52.070
I'm sure Yuki finds it very reassuring 
that you go to the same college, too.

06:52.540 --> 06:57.180
Unfortunately, I don't believe 
she shares that sentiment.

06:57.180 --> 07:02.440
Of course she does! 
You even know sign language!

07:03.760 --> 07:08.170
If she ever has trouble 
in college, I'm right there.

07:08.170 --> 07:08.940
Huh?

07:09.260 --> 07:12.550
You can always leave her in my hands.

07:13.230 --> 07:14.810
Thanks.

07:15.380 --> 07:17.760
Is Yuki-san doing okay these days?

07:17.760 --> 07:23.130
Oh, she just texted me saying she was 
staying the night at a friend's place.

07:23.130 --> 07:23.830
What?

07:23.830 --> 07:26.410
Rin-chan called me right after that, too.

07:26.410 --> 07:27.310
Oh...

07:27.310 --> 07:32.280
I feel like she hasn't stayed over 
at a friend's place since elementary school.

07:32.930 --> 07:36.090
<i>Understood. Goodbye.</i>

07:36.090 --> 07:37.560
<i>Okay, alibi secured!</i>

07:37.560 --> 07:39.140
<i>Thanks, Rin.</i>

07:39.700 --> 07:41.600
No way.

07:41.600 --> 07:42.510
Hmm?

07:42.510 --> 07:45.560
Oh, uh... Well...

07:45.560 --> 07:46.860
What?

07:47.640 --> 07:52.010
Do you mind giving me 
Yuki-san's contact details?

07:52.630 --> 07:54.360
Oh, man. Good work.

07:54.670 --> 07:56.060
You too.

07:56.060 --> 08:00.620
I'm so grateful that they chose to host 
their wedding afterparty here.

08:01.330 --> 08:05.980
Y'know, an afterparty can also 
be a good time for hookups.

08:05.980 --> 08:09.130
But you stole the spotlight. 
I felt bad for the guys.

08:10.400 --> 08:16.640
Remember how you said you weren't really 
looking for a girlfriend not so long ago?

08:17.250 --> 08:22.060
When you said that, I fully believed it. 
You're always going overseas and all.

08:22.490 --> 08:25.400
You're going somewhere on 
Monday too, aren't you?

08:26.020 --> 08:29.530
Itsu, where are you thinking of 
taking this thing with Yuki-chan?

08:31.760 --> 08:34.070
Why do you sound so worried?

08:34.070 --> 08:36.660
Because you worry <i>the heck</i> out of me!

08:36.660 --> 08:39.150
You've got a screw or two loose up there, man.

08:39.150 --> 08:42.120
You never book accommodations 
before you fly off somewhere.

08:42.120 --> 08:46.080
And, like, you seem likely to fall into 
some active volcano abroad and die.

08:46.080 --> 08:48.200
You keep going to these places!

08:48.200 --> 08:51.090
Yeah, they're not always fenced like in Japan.

08:51.090 --> 08:52.920
Don't try to distract me!

08:53.390 --> 08:56.380
How do you feel about Yuki-chan?!

08:56.380 --> 08:58.750
You sure enjoy romance chatter, huh?

08:58.750 --> 09:02.680
You bet I do! I love reading gossip 
about celebrity romances and stuff!

09:03.410 --> 09:05.990
That's not the point, though.

09:07.020 --> 09:10.580
This is, like, just my opinion, but...

09:12.690 --> 09:14.740
Yuki is crystal clear.

09:15.350 --> 09:19.370
That she's never had to hear any nasty words 
thrown her way probably plays a part.

09:21.660 --> 09:25.450
People are all empty glasses at first.

09:26.010 --> 09:31.930
And it's other people who scratch them up, 
make a mess of them, or help them shine.

09:33.200 --> 09:40.020
I thought I wanted 
to keep watching her forever.

09:40.540 --> 09:44.460
Her eyes, her hands, 
and her expressions are all beautiful.

09:45.920 --> 09:48.230
Now I'm no longer just "watching."

09:50.280 --> 09:54.010
I've just been captivated by her.

09:54.860 --> 09:59.480
<i>Bro's down bad! Does he not realize it?</i>

10:01.180 --> 10:03.620
Are you closed for the night?

10:03.620 --> 10:05.900
Oh, Rin-chan, Yuki-chan.

10:05.900 --> 10:06.870
Nah, you're good.

10:06.870 --> 10:07.920
Have a seat.

10:07.920 --> 10:09.210
Yay!

10:12.790 --> 10:14.630
<b>Don't you have a curfew?</b>

10:16.240 --> 10:18.600
She's spending the night at my place.

10:18.600 --> 10:21.960
Oh? Nice. The college life.

10:28.020 --> 10:29.230
Can I borrow her for a sec?

10:29.230 --> 10:31.100
Huh? Huh?!

10:33.510 --> 10:34.360
What?

10:35.000 --> 10:39.900
When did it start snowing? We had 
such good weather during the day, too.

10:40.360 --> 10:45.740
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

10:40.360 --> 10:45.740
<b>I'll be staying at Rin-chan's
place tonight. We're not
bothering you two by
showing up, are we?</b>

10:41.880 --> 10:42.660
Hmm?

10:43.410 --> 10:44.810
Oh, nah.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.580
So warm.

11:03.290 --> 11:08.260
The sky looked pretty similar 
the first time you came here too, right?

11:10.640 --> 11:13.650
<b>I didn't think I'd get to see you 
again before my trip.</b>

11:21.160 --> 11:22.910
<i>When I show her this,</i>

11:22.910 --> 11:26.410
<b>I didn't think I'd get to see you 
again before my trip.</b>

11:22.910 --> 11:26.410
<b>I was going to tell you this when we
met up after I got back, but screw that.</b>

11:23.520 --> 11:24.980
<i>she'll look at me.</i>

11:39.760 --> 11:41.630
I'll use sign

11:43.430 --> 11:45.140
to say it.

11:50.430 --> 11:52.770
Yuki.

11:52.980 --> 11:55.150
I want you to...

11:59.650 --> 12:03.560
<i>Does he realize what he's saying 
with that sign?</i>

12:04.050 --> 12:07.240
<i>Wait, I didn't even teach him that.</i>

12:10.820 --> 12:11.740
Yuki.

12:15.720 --> 12:17.130
How about we...

12:19.080 --> 12:20.390
become a couple?

12:28.480 --> 12:31.640
How about we become a couple?

12:41.230 --> 12:44.320
<b></b>Why?

12:41.230 --> 12:44.320
Why?

12:44.320 --> 12:45.940
"Why"?

12:46.480 --> 12:48.830
Because I'd like to go out with you.

12:51.120 --> 12:53.580
<b></b>Why?

12:51.120 --> 12:53.580
Why?

12:56.200 --> 12:58.500
I wasn't really expecting all this, either.

12:59.330 --> 13:01.930
I'll probably keep traveling to places

13:02.360 --> 13:05.030
and meet all kinds of people during my travels.

13:05.030 --> 13:09.830
But none of those places will have you.

13:12.760 --> 13:14.470
<i>My vision's getting blurry.</i>

13:15.760 --> 13:19.420
<i>I can only figure out bits and pieces...</i>

13:23.330 --> 13:25.110
Can you still read my lips?

13:27.270 --> 13:29.190
<i>Not all of it.</i>

13:36.070 --> 13:39.130
I want you, Yuki.

13:45.730 --> 13:47.780
Is your answer gonna be an okay?

13:52.120 --> 13:53.740
<i>Itsuomi-san...</i>

14:04.680 --> 14:05.640
Yeah?

14:08.680 --> 14:09.800
Cool.

14:09.800 --> 14:10.620
<i>Huh?</i>

14:10.620 --> 14:12.370
<b></b>I want her

14:10.620 --> 14:12.390
<i>He's awfully cool about it.</i>

14:12.370 --> 14:13.990
<b></b>Who's her?

14:12.390 --> 14:17.620
<i>What is this? The same vibes 
as that one playground game?</i>

14:13.990 --> 14:15.620
<b></b>I want her

14:15.620 --> 14:17.250
<b></b>Who's her?

14:17.250 --> 14:17.620
<b></b>I want her

14:18.980 --> 14:23.500
I'll learn... more... sign language.

14:34.500 --> 14:36.600
Why d'you have your arm draped over her?

14:36.600 --> 14:40.690
Uh... so, we're going out.

14:42.690 --> 14:44.940
Wh-Wh-Where did that come from?!

14:44.940 --> 14:46.200
What? Really?!

14:46.200 --> 14:47.480
You're going out?!

14:47.480 --> 14:48.620
For real?!

14:48.620 --> 14:51.200
<i>Their lips are moving too fast to read.</i>

14:52.000 --> 14:52.820
Huh?

14:53.130 --> 14:55.790
Whoa, all three of you 
have the exact same look.

14:55.790 --> 14:57.330
Well, <i>duh</i>!

14:57.330 --> 14:59.540
Man... Wow.

15:00.980 --> 15:02.970
That's crazy, Yuki.

15:02.970 --> 15:05.080
Don't hide your lips, Rin.

15:05.670 --> 15:08.300
Itsu, of all people?

15:08.300 --> 15:10.300
Kyouya, get me a beer.

15:10.300 --> 15:11.680
Right away.

15:12.010 --> 15:16.080
So, how are you when you're 
dating someone, Itsuomi-san?

15:16.080 --> 15:17.450
Normal?

15:17.450 --> 15:20.360
And I wanna know what "normal" means to you!

15:21.440 --> 15:26.440
Cool, cool! You did seem 
to have taken a liking to Yuki!

15:27.050 --> 15:30.840
I'm so happy for you, Yuki!

15:27.050 --> 15:33.570
<i>Rin-chan's glee is starting 
to make this all sink in.</i>

15:34.290 --> 15:38.080
<i>He really is such an enigma.</i>

15:39.950 --> 15:40.750
Let's bounce.

15:40.750 --> 15:44.040
Huh? There's so much more 
I'd like to talk about.

15:44.040 --> 15:47.690
Yuki has a 10 PM curfew, right? It's past ten.

15:48.090 --> 15:51.390
Like we said, she's spending the night at mine.

15:51.390 --> 15:54.090
Yeah, but her folks don't know 
you're out right now, do they?

15:54.090 --> 15:55.950
Oh, right.

15:55.950 --> 15:57.690
I'll walk her to your place.

15:57.690 --> 15:58.850
I'll go, too.

15:59.240 --> 16:01.310
Why don't you stay and drink some more?

16:02.290 --> 16:04.900
Walk her later, Kyouya.

16:05.300 --> 16:08.240
Okay. Stick around some more, Rin-chan.

16:08.240 --> 16:09.070
Sure!

16:09.810 --> 16:11.820
This is the key to my place.

16:12.360 --> 16:14.090
That reminds me.

16:14.090 --> 16:18.810
Yuki saw some girl handing you 
a key and got worried.

16:18.810 --> 16:22.180
Oh... yeah, that's a thing.

16:22.180 --> 16:23.160
Got it.

16:23.970 --> 16:24.830
Let's go.

16:24.830 --> 16:28.090
<i>Huh? Is Rin-chan not coming with us?</i>

16:37.930 --> 16:43.730
Aren't you glad you got
to walk home together?

16:37.930 --> 16:43.730
I'll head back in a while myself.

16:38.550 --> 16:43.730
<i>Aren't you glad you got to walk home together?
I'll head back in a while myself.</i>

16:44.090 --> 16:48.120
<i>I see. She's spending some 
alone time with the boss, too.</i>

16:49.480 --> 16:51.360
<b>Emma giving me that key...</b>

16:49.480 --> 16:51.940
<i>Huh? Itsuomi-san?</i>

16:53.150 --> 16:55.990
Emma giving me that key?
Don't worry about it.

16:58.740 --> 17:03.750
I'd just let her borrow
my apartment.

16:59.460 --> 17:02.820
<i>I'm not sure I understand what 
"borrowing an apartment" is all about.</i>

17:05.120 --> 17:07.130
I won't do it again.

17:10.520 --> 17:15.500
<i>I'm not sure how much say 
I have in his friendships.</i>

17:16.750 --> 17:19.190
<i>I don't want to cause any issues.</i>

17:19.770 --> 17:25.240
<i>And I certainly don't want to 
make his world a smaller place.</i>

17:27.410 --> 17:28.250
<i>Huh?</i>

17:29.080 --> 17:31.280
<i>I've got some other messages.</i>

17:29.190 --> 17:32.400
<b>Oushi</b>

17:29.190 --> 17:32.400
<b>Oushi</b>

17:31.280 --> 17:32.520
<i>Oushi-kun?</i>

17:33.440 --> 17:35.030
Today

17:33.440 --> 17:35.030
I got your ID
\hfrom your mom.

17:33.440 --> 17:35.030
Add me.

17:33.440 --> 17:35.030
Oushi.

17:35.480 --> 17:38.530
<i>What? Why now?</i>

17:39.250 --> 17:44.260
<i>Oh, yeah. Why were he and Itsuomi-san 
scowling at each other the other day?</i>

17:45.480 --> 17:47.370
<i>I'll add him later.</i>

18:01.860 --> 18:05.390
<i>He's holding my hand.</i>

18:05.800 --> 18:09.060
<i>He was always just grabbing it before.</i>

18:09.600 --> 18:12.400
<i>Oh, so this is what...</i>

18:13.110 --> 18:15.300
<i>holding hands is like.</i>

18:16.950 --> 18:20.950
<i>The way his hands moved 
back there was so assertive.</i>

18:23.760 --> 18:28.060
<i>I don't even feel like 
I'm walking home right now.</i>

18:30.570 --> 18:33.550
Man, that nearly gave me a heart attack.

18:33.550 --> 18:37.530
I never expected them 
to start going out tonight.

18:37.530 --> 18:39.050
Right?

18:39.050 --> 18:45.020
But Itsuomi-san was 
the same as ever, wasn't he?

18:45.020 --> 18:46.840
I'm worried...

18:48.080 --> 18:51.310
Y'know, I think he was actually on cloud nine.

18:51.310 --> 18:54.800
What? You mean he was putting on a front?

18:54.800 --> 18:57.840
I don't think he was hiding it or anything.

18:57.840 --> 19:01.600
Maybe you couldn't see it, but for me, 
it was quite apparent in his face.

19:01.600 --> 19:02.820
Good for him.

19:02.820 --> 19:06.460
Yeah. All the best to those two.

19:08.910 --> 19:10.470
Hey, Shin.

19:12.040 --> 19:13.330
Where's Itsu-kun?

19:13.690 --> 19:15.920
Done for the night. He left.

19:15.920 --> 19:17.400
Oh...

19:17.880 --> 19:18.840
You're leaving?

19:19.340 --> 19:20.470
Sure you don't want a drink?

19:23.280 --> 19:25.980
Nah, I don't wanna be the third wheel.

19:41.360 --> 19:45.370
Thank you for walking me.

19:43.870 --> 19:45.370
Sure.

19:45.370 --> 19:48.120
Thank you for walking me.

19:45.370 --> 19:48.120
Sure.

19:45.740 --> 19:48.120
Have a safe trip.

19:54.130 --> 19:56.630
Have a safe trip.

19:54.130 --> 19:56.630
Thanks.

19:54.420 --> 19:56.630
Do you have a passport?

20:01.010 --> 20:04.300
Do you have a passport?

20:01.010 --> 20:04.340
I don't. I do want to try
going overseas, though.

20:04.220 --> 20:05.890
I don't. I do want to try
going overseas, though.

20:04.260 --> 20:05.890
Get one, and I'll
take you.

20:05.890 --> 20:09.640
<i>I can go with him?</i>

20:10.390 --> 20:15.900
I'll do that. And I'll
save up money.

20:13.140 --> 20:15.900
It'll be my immediate goal.

20:20.050 --> 20:20.970
Later.

20:21.860 --> 20:23.400
<b></b>See you.

20:21.860 --> 20:23.400
<b></b>See you.

20:45.840 --> 20:46.790
Yuki.

21:28.150 --> 21:33.300
<i>These hands that hold me, 
those eyes that gaze upon me...</i>

21:34.420 --> 21:37.880
<i>will see yet another new, uncharted world.</i>

21:39.520 --> 21:44.180
<i>I don't want you to think I only see what's 
around me, so I won't say it to you,</i>

21:45.300 --> 21:49.820
<i>but I've even fallen in love with 
looking up at your face like this.</i>

21:50.880 --> 21:56.150
<i>Every expression you show me 
drenches me in a shower of light.</i>

21:57.040 --> 21:59.720
<i>On this day, February 21st,</i>

21:59.720 --> 22:03.880
<i>our worlds came together as one.</i>

22:00.590 --> 22:04.590
I Thought I Wanted to Keep Watching Her Forever

22:49.990 --> 22:53.220
<i>So, why did you choose now?</i>

22:53.660 --> 22:54.920
What do you mean?

22:54.920 --> 22:56.860
<i>You're going on a trip on Monday.</i>

22:57.720 --> 23:01.170
You go away right after you start dating? 
That'll suck for her.

23:01.170 --> 23:05.440
<i>I didn't want to regret anything, like, 
"I should've asked her out sooner."</i>

23:05.440 --> 23:06.480
Huh...

23:06.480 --> 23:09.790
Y'know, we only just started dating...

23:09.790 --> 23:10.520
<i>Yeah?</i>

23:11.810 --> 23:14.740
But I don't see Yuki and I breaking up.

23:17.040 --> 23:18.670
<i>What's with the silence?</i>

23:18.670 --> 23:20.750
You sounded so young and innocent.

23:21.080 --> 23:26.540
Not that there's anything wrong with that. 
I'm rooting for the two of you.

23:26.540 --> 23:27.770
<i>Cheers.</i>

23:27.770 --> 23:28.760
Bye.

23:32.740 --> 23:35.010
Hot damn,

23:35.350 --> 23:37.670
he really is on cloud nine.
